# Read Oasis — local-first reading companion (baseline, milestone 1)

Author: Huy Tran · Cadence Design Systems Vietnam · huytran@cadence.com · Created: 2026-09-27
Spec: `../ref_docs/ReadOasis_Three_Year_Learning_App_Spec.md` (v1.0)

> Not a medical product. Display defaults are testing defaults to tune with the child on the real device.
> Nothing here claims a reading-level gain or a myopia benefit.

## 1. Repository inventory (spec §2)

Existing repo `Vuon-hoc-tap-AB/` is a set of **single-file Vietnamese learning apps** (`toan3.html`,
`tiengviet3.html`, `vuon-hoc-tap*.html`, `Quynh-Edu-Garden.html`, …), each ~3–5k lines of inline CSS/JS,
progress in `localStorage`, optional Supabase sync (`supabase_*.sql`), HP001 handwriting fonts, and a
`push.ps1` GitHub uploader. No build step, no package manager, no test folder, no shared component library.

**Reused:** the deployment model (static files, no bundler), the `localStorage`-first habit, the `bak/`
backup convention, and the visual tone (calm cards, large type). **Not reused:** Supabase (spec §1
local-first, §8.1 "no cloud DB merely because it appeared earlier"), the monolithic single-file pattern
(spec §8.1 asks for separable components), and any existing book/illustration content (none is English
reading content; nothing was copied).

Nothing in the existing repo was modified. Read Oasis lives entirely in `read-oasis/`.

